<title>USA: NatCity Bank PA sets $200 mln debt, yld 7.35 pct.</title>
<headline>NatCity Bank PA sets $200 mln debt, yld 7.35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from NatCity Bank Pennsylvania was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER NATCITY BANK PENNSYLVANIA</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	  COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 10/21/11</p>
<p>TYPE SUB BANK NOTES ISS PRICE 99.100  FIRST PAY DATE 4/21/97 LAST MOODY A1	 YIELD 7.35 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A   SPREAD 75 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER 10-YEAR U.S TREASURY NOTE --U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
